      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0002",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "This method activates the audio session, so pass [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false) to [`setActive:error:`](avaudiosession/setactive:error:.md) if immediate playback isn’t necessary.",
      "normalizedSource": "This method activates the audio session, so pass [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false) to [`setActive:error:`](avaudiosession/setactive:error:.md) if immediate playback isn’t necessary.",
      "sourceHash": "bb26ab634e8f3e13f325910eac65899f01368060d355ecd9b29a98ffbcd13dfe",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Calling this method preloads audio buffers and acquires the audio hardware necessary for playback.",
      "contextAfter": "For example, when using the category option [`duckOthers`](avaudiosession/categoryoptions-swift.struct/duckothers.md), this method lowers the audio outside of the app.",
      "documentTitle": "prepareToPlay()",
      "framework": "AVFAudio",
      "ko": "이 메서드는 오디오 세션을 활성화하므로 즉시 재생이 필요하지 않을 때는 [`setActive:error:`](avaudiosession/setactive:error:.md)에 [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false)를 전달합니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
