    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0003",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "For example, when using the category option [`duckOthers`](avaudiosession/categoryoptions-swift.struct/duckothers.md), this method lowers the audio outside of the app.",
      "normalizedSource": "For example, when using the category option [`duckOthers`](avaudiosession/categoryoptions-swift.struct/duckothers.md), this method lowers the audio outside of the app.",
      "sourceHash": "35a3091e48c097d68213425fda7b2b9cf0b00e4f08b74a135fe3b3464c4041bf",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "This method activates the audio session, so pass [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false) to [`setActive:error:`](avaudiosession/setactive:error:.md) if immediate playback isn’t necessary.",
      "contextAfter": "The system calls this method when using the method [`play()`](avaudioplayer/play().md), but calling it in advance minimizes the delay between calling `play()` and the start of sound output.",
      "documentTitle": "prepareToPlay()",
      "framework": "AVFAudio",
      "ko": "예를 들어 카테고리 옵션 [`duckOthers`](avaudiosession/categoryoptions-swift.struct/duckothers.md) 사용 시, 이 메서드는 앱 외부의 오디오 볼륨을 낮춥니다.",
