      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0011",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The system calls this method when using the method [`play()`](avaudioplayer/play().md), but calling it in advance minimizes the delay between calling `play()` and the start of sound output.",
      "normalizedSource": "The system calls this method when using the method [`play()`](avaudioplayer/play().md), but calling it in advance minimizes the delay between calling `play()` and the start of sound output.",
      "sourceHash": "a84c45dc4068e250fec932eb8a723e4e3fde6f989bb671280d2de0247c5b7835",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "For example, when using the category option [`duckOthers`](avaudiosession/categoryoptions-swift.struct/duckothers.md), this method lowers the audio outside of the app.",
      "contextAfter": "Calling [`stop()`](avaudioplayer/stop().md), or allowing a sound to finish playing, undoes this setup.",
      "documentTitle": "prepareToPlay()",
      "framework": "AVFAudio",
      "ko": "시스템은 [`play()`](avaudioplayer/play().md) 사용 시 이 메서드를 호출하지만, 미리 호출하면 `play()` 호출 시점과 소리 출력 시작 시점 사이의 지연이 줄어듭니다.",
